You line your armor with explosive plating that detonates when struck. On taking a melee or ranged hit that deals more than 8% of your maximum life a plate detonates, reducing the damage taken by [12%, 20%, 26%, 31%, 35% (TL1-5)] and triggering a basic grenade attack in a radius [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] cone projected at the target dealing 25% of its usual damage.

This cannot trigger more than once per turn.

Blocking an attack with your shield will also trigger the retaliation damage, if it has not already triggered this turn.

You have up to 3 plates at a time, and regain one every [9, 8, 7, 6, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.
